    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56924" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιος </span></b> ( <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κερτόμ-εος</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>EM</u>
			102.46
		</span></i>), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>mocking, taunting</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κερτομίοις ἐπέεσσιν πειρηθῆναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					24.240
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δία Κρονίδην ἐρεθίζειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.419
				</span></i>
			; simply 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κερτομίοισι Δία προσηύδα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.539
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				9.474
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ὀργαῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					956
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν κ. γλώσσαις</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				962
			</span></i> (lyr.). (Perh. for (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κερ-στομος</span>, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκέραφος, κέραφος.</span>)</div>
